      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to see the material count separated for particle systems and the avatars. It's the particle systems that make my numbers massive. But these are all on gesture combinations and rarely active. People who look at the stats usually don't get that concept.\n\nSince you can see particles I'd like to see the performance degradation kick in only when the avatar material slot count exceeds the limit.\n\nOfc that should only apply for the performance block options below very poor.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
